<title>HONG KONG: Bear Stearns sets call warrants on HK power basket.</title>
<headline>Bear Stearns sets call warrants on HK power basket.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-06-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Bear Stearns Companies Inc said it priced on Monday 525 million American-style call warrants on a basket of two power stocks.</p>
<p>Each basket comprises of:</p>
<p>    China Light &amp; Power Co Ltd	    0.1 share</p>
<p>    Hongkong Electric Holdings Ltd	0.1 share</p>
<p>Ten warrant control one basket.</p>
<p>    STRIKE PRICE	 HK$6.688    PREMIUM	    9.84 PCT</p>
<p>    ISSUE PRICE	  HK$0.1045   GEARING	    6.74 x</p>
<p>    EXPIRATION	   2.APR.98    MIN EXER LOT     50,000</p>
<p>    REFERENCE SPOT     HK$7.04     SETTLEMENT DATE  24.JUN.97</p>
<p>LISTING HONG KONG LISTING DATE 26.JUN.97</p>
<p>    NOTE		   WITH ISSUER'S CASH OPTION</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong Newsroom (852) 2843 6590.  http://www.hk97.com</p>
